 Task 3: Create a one-file temporary local-web launcher, success\n26-\n--\n28-\n29:- rollout_summaries/2026-07-20T14-01-18-PQMw-seongon_lms_docker_wsl_to_simple_local_web_launcher.md (cwd=\\\\?\\D:\\CODE\\seongon-lms, rollout_path=\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\AL\\.codex\\sessions\\2026\\07\\20\\rollout-2026-07-20T21-01-23-019f7fd4-c6da-7652-aab9-15d05b73de68.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-03T08:25:08+00:00, thread_id=019f7fd4-c6da-7652-aab9-15d05b73de68, parser-verified launcher for an already-installed local stack)\n30-\n--\n32-\n33:- Infra/start-local-web-windows.ps1, MySQL80, Laravel, Vite, 127.0.0.1:8000, 127.0.0.1:5173, http://localhost:5173, PowerShell 5.1\n34-\n--\n42-\n43:- On this Windows 11 Pro machine, `VirtualizationFirmwareEnabled=True` and `SLAT=True` ruled out BIOS/CPU incompatibility; missing WSL was the Docker Desktop blocker. `wsl --install`, reboot, `wsl --update`, `wsl --set-default-version 2`, and `wsl --version` verified WSL `2.7.10.0`. A user Ubuntu distribution is not required because Docker uses `docker-desktop`. [Task 1]\n44-- The full Smart Runner spec and plan are `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-03-smart-native-development-runner-design.md` and `docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-03-smart-native-development-runner.md`. It had an implementation and fix round but no final scoped re-review; do not recommend it as complete. [Task 2] [ad-hoc note]\n45:- `Infra/start-local-web-windows.ps1` checks `MySQL80`, required Laravel/frontend files, PHP, and npm; starts Laravel on `127.0.0.1:8000` and Vite on `127.0.0.1:5173`, waits for `/up` and `/`, then opens `http://localhost:5173`. Run from repo root: `powershell.exe -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File '.\\\\Infra\\\\start-local-web-windows.ps1'`. [Task 3]\n46:- The launcher deliberately does not install dependencies, migrate, seed, build, hash files, manage persistent PIDs, or delete Docker/WSL. Parser and static safety checks passed; live execution was not performed. [Task 3]\n47-\n--\n49-\n50:- symptom: Docker reports missing virtualization -> cause: treating all virtualization errors as BIOS/CPU incompatibility -> fix: check `VirtualizationFirmwareEnabled`, `SLAT`, and WSL status first; install WSL when firmware/SLAT are valid. [Task 1]\n51-- symptom: the minimal request gets turned back into orchestration -> cause: continuing the original Smart Runner scope after the user simplified it -> fix: resume the full runner only for explicit dependency invalidation, migration/seed, conditional build, PID ownership, status/logs/stop/restart, or full-automation requests. [Task 2] [ad-hoc note]\n--\n156-\n157:# Task Group: D:\\CODE\\seongon-lms / production Docker stack, operator workflow, and branch-sync verification\n158:scope: `seongon-lms` infrastructure/runtime tasks where the user wants a production-oriented Docker stack for Laravel + Vite, simple operator docs, and proof from builds, tests, live smoke checks, or exact branch-sync verification instead of design-only discussion.\n159:applies_to: cwd=D:\\CODE\\seongon-lms; reuse_rule=reuse for similar production-stack, operator-workflow, or deploy-readiness work after re-checking `Infra/docker-compose.yml`, Dockerfiles, current repo Git state, and whether the user wants architecture planning, implementation, or full runtime verification.\n160-\n161:## Task 1: Lock the production Docker architecture and implementation plan, success\n162-\n--\n164-\n165:- rollout_summaries/2026-07-12T10-20-45-SbD1-production_docker_stack_and_run_script.md (cwd=\\\\?\\D:\\CODE\\seongon-lms, rollout_path=C:\\Users\\AL\\.codex\\sessions\\2026\\07\\12\\rollout-2026-07-12T17-20-51-019f55d7-f973-7901-aadf-9cedc6ef94ff.jsonl, updated_at=2026-07-13T14:24:55+00:00, thread_id=019f55d7-f973-7901-aadf-9cedc6ef94ff, production stack implemented on `main` with design/plan context preserved)\n166-\n--\n174-\n175:- rollout_summaries/2026-07-12T10-20-45-SbD1-production_docker_stack_and_run_script.md (cwd=\\\\?\\D:\\CODE\\seongon-lms, rollout_path=C:\\Users\\AL\\